	(text "POWER\n-------\nStop 2 = 3.0 uA (16 kB SRAM)\n-------\nPower up voltage range 4 (<= 25 MHz) = 2.5 mA\nRun for 1000 cycles @ 25 MHz = 40 us runtime per second\n2.5 mA * (40 us / 1 s) \n= 100 nA additional load\n-------\nLEDs = "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 72.898 35.814 0)
		(effects
